text:
@HerbalistChief I’m sure this herb is powerful but it cannot reverse kidney failure by itself.

Early stage kidney disease can  only be reversed with your diet through Carb and protein counting and reducing the workload of the kidneys.

End stage kidney disease cannot be reversed.

